# Paths whose edits never need the unit suite at Stop (stop-gate ADR-0137 path predicate).
# Mirrors the paths-ignore of .github/workflows/ci.yml, narrowed: CI's '*.md' is root-only in
# GitHub's glob, but here '*' also matches '/', so root files are named one by one and a new
# markdown file anywhere else (a test fixture, say) still arms the suite.
